From 088ad71dec87177d6e3dc36b3bf5da8bf26c9116 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (for MrMIB)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 06:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] add Back-end/Render/render.js: headless frame-exact
 rendering to images / mp4

node Back-end/Render/render.js file.cdrca --out frames/ [--fps --width --height --duration --format --video]

Runs the unmodified Front-end/three.js + Renderer.js in headless Chromium (playwright) with
requestAnimationFrame replaced by a manual clock, so each frame is rendered at an exact timestamp.
Files the script refers to resolve relative to the .cdrca file. Errors are JSON on stderr + non-zero exit.
playwright is only required to run this file; nothing else in the repo depends on it.
Adds tests/render.test.js (skips if playwright is not installed).
